            <div xml:id="m-66f891a2-5346-4410-a122-55d5c71cb610">
              <lg xml:id="m-5df0827a-abf0-4af1-b519-3219f2bd9623">
                <l xml:id="m-2a83f1af-c745-48d2-9117-6d804fd1793a" facs="#m-15140c30-beb1-4052-aa4c-4899bb5694da" label="ambiguous">MAUNDY THURSDAY</l><l xml:id="m-bd56020e-b72f-4616-9bc5-a66193421c8e" facs="#m-fe441758-7c39-4073-9491-7e1adbd7df20" label="text-like">Double of the First Class</l><l xml:id="m-b30c4c0e-fa1a-42aa-8f94-76853c4d7a46" facs="#m-29011c3a-91a0-4762-bd5e-4fbaa7326755" label="text-like">AT MATINS</l><l xml:id="m-e5e5b561-4f17-4eb9-961a-521921945ed5" facs="#m-a8819f8f-ddba-45e4-944d-a1d8c362d27c" label="text-like">The altar is prepared vith cross and six lighted candles, but without</l><l xml:id="m-6b8a5fb7-c7de-417f-9157-c7aa6aff13da" facs="#m-6cc051be-bc77-4133-a6bf-f351940ca534" label="ambiguous">ornament.</l><l xml:id="m-dd66872b-0ace-4a9c-8ffa-9e11d4aa4f4f" facs="#m-754092f2-2ee1-4ec0-9d23-908752262400" label="ambiguous">INTHE IST NOCTURN</l><l xml:id="m-dd3ee884-8fbc-4d11-b72c-21ddebe6690c" facs="#m-d53e4236-7712-4c51-8404-b80aa2433631" label="ambiguous">1 Ant.</l><l xml:id="m-b8ae9e78-735e-4c92-b7a4-7b98c64c1239" facs="#m-95b9c895-1016-4101-86d5-fde246b7142e" label="lyrics-like">Elus dómus tú-ae“ comédit me, et oppróbri-a</l><l xml:id="m-5fefd1d8-cb55-43d6-a36e-646bd1db9799" facs="#m-4e732a30-bfcf-40dd-94c1-cc8561761e60" label="lyrics-like">exprobránti-um tí-bi ce-cidé runt super me.</l><l xml:id="m-8a38fe21-afa7-44e3-b9a2-99bbbd1eb011" facs="#m-1886daf5-4ee8-42d2-9e6f-0a348819c59a" label="ambiguous">Psalm 68 (New psalter, p. 28*)</l><l xml:id="m-e16d6c99-f16b-4bf8-ae75-1a8c1a783990" facs="#m-799c9837-c4bc-4af7-bb74-907b65c6364b" label="lyrics-like">1. Sálvum me fac, Dé¬ us:" quóni-am intravérunt áquae</l><l xml:id="m-57cee2f6-bfaf-4b69-b983-893abed64da6" facs="#m-331c42af-9864-4652-9500-15d18ded050f" label="lyrics-like">usque ad ánimam mé¬ am. Flez: tempéstas áquae, t</l><l xml:id="m-a3fb345f-3eee-4c7b-aa2e-745b3c2caec1" facs="#m-3a304025-7c2b-41db-b317-a9491916c91a" label="lyrics-like">2. Infíxus sum in límo profúndi: *et non est substántia.</l><l xml:id="m-a63687e3-a4eb-4806-a3f1-9e9d29e04dfe" facs="#m-94474481-8d6b-41eb-baef-250f3dfe730b" label="lyrics-like">3. Véni in altitúdinem máris:“et tempéstas demérsit me.</l><l xml:id="m-f62d473b-5147-4389-8ea0-90d87605fdf0" facs="#m-6581c486-c24e-4d81-a023-bf30fa45c028" label="lyrics-like">4. Laborávi clámans, ráucae fáctae sunt fáuces méae:</l><l xml:id="m-57931b53-f550-432a-96f3-6d050675169a" facs="#m-45e37ed6-547e-4e6a-9913-cd7011f10d18" label="lyrics-like">defecérunt óculi méi, dum spéro in Déum méum.</l><l xml:id="m-fb1a52c7-3c3e-4c01-b68c-a0c02a443c0d" facs="#m-a3672ed9-071c-4e7e-96fe-490b2c2f184c" label="lyrics-like">5. Multiplicáti sunt super capillos cápitis méi, “qui odérunt</l><l xml:id="m-b90f5fdb-7be8-4dce-956f-b23b4cb57df2" facs="#m-d3c99387-aa9c-40d2-9678-ea3a7bc0a35e" label="lyrics-like">me grátis.</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
